---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import data from "../data/chambers.json";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this website handles data."
>
  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <span class="kicker">Privacy</span>
    <div>
      <h1 class="title title--sub">Privacy</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          This website has no account system, no advertising and no
          third-party trackers. The only personal data it collects is what you
          choose to enter into the enquiry form.
        </p>

        <p>
          No cookies are set by this website. Web fonts are served by Google
          Fonts, which receives your IP address as a necessary part of
          delivering the font files. No other third party receives data.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you use the enquiry form, the name, contact details and
          description you provide are received by the chambers and routed to an
          advocate who is able to accept the matter. That information is used
          only to respond to your enquiry and to decide whether the chambers can
          assist. It is not shared with anyone outside the chambers, and it is
          not used for marketing.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not send confidential facts or documents before an advocate
          has been formally instructed. A first enquiry does not create an
          advocate-client relationship and is not protected as privileged
          communication.
        </p>

        <p>
          Server access logs may be retained by the hosting provider for
          security and diagnostic purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
          For any question about this notice, contact the chambers clerk at{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${data.chambers.clerk.email}`}>
            {data.chambers.clerk.email}
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
